          "text": "Hebrews connects the promise of rest with the warning drawn from the wilderness story. The chapter moves from the failure to enter rest to an appeal to hold fast and approach for mercy and help, while its language about God\u2019s word emphasizes life, activity, discernment, and accountability.",
