          "text": "The exhortation develops the theme of rest through Psalm 95, the wilderness failure, creation, Joshua, and Sabbath. Early witnesses such as Papyrus 46 help with transmission history, but the manuscript evidence and the chapter\u2019s later canonical connections should remain distinct from the chapter\u2019s immediate claims.",
